<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock</p>
<p>Exchange closed lower in light trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 561.34, off 2.05.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 286 to 207.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 15,451,300, compared with 16,450,450 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
